OL,3,APrince Harry praises war veterans on
OL,4,Asurprise visit to Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine has more than 150,000 injured
OL,7,Fwar veterans and the prince visited
OL,8,Fprojects supporting their treatment and
OL,9,Frehabilitation.
